; rent-to-zero-goal.form — the goal + exit proof for walking every answered enquiry from a rented mind's
; loop toward the north star: an intelligence that runs from the inside out, grounds on its own body,
; spends rent only where the body cannot yet speak, and shows every crossing in a receipt. Companion
; to NORTH_STAR.md (the direction) and receipts/2026-09-18-direct-vs-guided-form-cli.md (the ladder
; this goal is pinned to). The daily door is observe/form-cli-grounded-synthesis-run.bml.

(rent-to-zero-goal

  ; ── GROUND ──
  (ground
    (definition    "RENT = provider input+output tokens spent to answer one enquiry, read from the provider's own
                    completed usage AND cross-checked by the body's share meter token-pressure lane; the two agree
                    or the reading is withheld. GROUND = the bytes of the answer's packet that native doors produced
                    (enrich, receipt index, census, meters) before any provider turn. The walk: rent falls, ground
                    rises, and every step lands with a receipt the next step can measure against.")
    (measure-PINNED "the enquiry is receipts/artifacts/2026-09-18-form-cli-enquiry.txt; the terms are
                     'quality volume frequency vitality trust traceability sovereignty resonance rented membrane';
                     jq -nc --rawfile e receipts/artifacts/2026-09-18-form-cli-enquiry.txt --arg t '<terms>'
                       '{enquiry:$e,terms:$t,seconds:600,receipts:8}' | ./form-run ./fkwu observe/form-cli-grounded-synthesis-run.bml
                     → read input_plus_output_tokens, packet_bytes, receipts; then count receipt paths cited in the answer.
                     PIN TO THIS ENQUIRY. A different enquiry is a different reading, never a comparison.")
    (reading       "2026-09-18 on fkwu, same enquiry: guided session ≥ 7,032,893 across 40 provider calls;
                    direct (one organ call, unbounded loop inside) 648,411, 9 calls, 20 tools, 0 Form cells;
                    bounded (one turn, enrich in prompt) 44,495, 0 receipts cited;
                    grounded door 13,222, 1 turn, 0 tools, 4 receipts cited, grounding 20 ms.")
    (ladder        "7,032,893 → 648,411 → 44,495 → 13,222 → next rung → 0. Each rung is a door that exists.")
    (truer-measure "tokens under-read the win when the answer is hollow: record ALSO receipts cited by path, the
                    caller's checks passed, and the mirror count. A cheap answer that cites nothing is a rung
                    down, not up. Resonance as felt stays the person's reading and is never a number here."))

  ; ── WHAT STANDS (each names its cell; re-observed 2026-09-18) ──
  (stands
    (S1 "grounded door"     "observe/form-cli-grounded-synthesis-run.bml — native enrich + dated receipt index, then
                             one provider turn, no tools, own config home, own session identity; report carries usage")
    (S2 "process organ"     "observe/form-cli-heal-process-run.bml — one owned process, health/cadence/exit/timing
                             events, evidence directory; the only way a provider is launched from inside the body")
    (S3 "crossing census"   "observe/form-cli-native-call-census-run.fk — one native call inside a membrane window;
                             the enrich step crosses only the filesystem plane, 5 dispatches")
    (S4 "meters"            "form/form-stdlib/form-cli-share-run.fk (token-pressure lane reads the provider's own
                             13,222); observe/rented-turn-meter-run.fk (the rented mind's own output tokens)")
    (S5 "native ground"     "form-stdlib/bml/form-cli-enrich.bml (seeds, senses, relations); grounded <question>
                             over the healed RAG index; zg over resident tool rows; receipts/ as a dated corpus"))

  ; ── THE WALK (biggest confident step first; each step names door, measure, witness, and who decides) ──
  (walk
    (W1 "one door for every enquiry"
        (size       "removes the rented mind's loop from ordinary enquiries: 7,032,893 → 13,222 on the pinned enquiry")
        (confidence "highest — S1 exists and is measured; the step is making it the ask lane's default:
                     ground natively, spend one turn only when the native ground does not answer the caller's checks")
        (vitality   "every enquiry leaves a report row and an answer at an evidence path; the body learns what it
                     was asked and what it could ground")
        (trust      "say = do: the provider's usage and the share meter's lane agree on one number per enquiry")
        (sovereignty "Form decides what crosses; the provider decides nothing outside its one turn; no tools inside")
        (witness    "a form-cli ask that lands through S1 with kind=observed on its report; the pinned reading
                     re-run and recorded before/after"))
    (W2 "ground by content, not by name"
        (size       "receipts cited per answer 4 → the caller's checks passed on the pinned enquiry; packet stays
                     under 8 KB; rent stays at or under 13,222")
        (confidence "high — grounded <question> and zg already stand (S5); the step routes them into S1's packet")
        (vitality   "the corpus of 1,982 receipts becomes reachable by meaning; edges land with the answer")
        (trust      "every cited path is a real file whose opening the packet carried; the answer says what
                     would need the full receipt")
        (sovereignty "the body chooses which of its own cells the provider sees")
        (witness    "receipts cited by path ≥ 6 with the caller's checks green; packet_bytes and tokens recorded"))
    (W3 "the body witnesses its own provider turns"
        (size       "kind=observed share on every turn the body launches; the last 'declared' lane closes")
        (confidence "medium — the collector recognizes Codex rollouts and interactive transcripts; a headless
                     transcript's terminal row is the one unrecognized shape")
        (vitality   "the share meter stops withholding on the cheapest route")
        (trust      "the body's reading, not the provider's, is the number a receipt carries")
        (sovereignty "measurement stays native; no provider self-report stands alone")
        (witness    "form-cli-turn-evidence bands green; a live S1 run reads kind=observed"))
    (W4 "a smaller turn"
        (size       "uncached input 5,547 → under 3,000 on the pinned enquiry; cache_write 5,545 → 0 on a repeat
                     within the cache window")
        (confidence "medium — the embodied-goal grammar already lowers intent; the step lowers the packet's
                     framing and reuses the provider's cached prefix")
        (vitality   "less repeated context per answer; more of each token is the enquiry")
        (trust      "the lowering is typed evidence (compression tag), never a silent trim of the enquiry")
        (sovereignty "the lowering lives in BML the body owns")
        (witness    "pinned reading before/after; fcpdag-compression receipt beside it"))
    (W5 "native voice takes the turn where it can"
        (size       "rent 13,222 → 0 on every enquiry the resident model answers within the caller's checks")
        (confidence "medium — fcmg-generate-resident and the response-resource pattern stand; quality gaps are
                     known and receipted; needs a host with Metal and an admitted model")
        (vitality   "HOMECOMING.md's path: the voice speaks, the provider reviews, then retires lane by lane")
        (trust      "the native answer is checked by the same caller assertions before it is served; a provider is
                     asked only after a retained native failure, and both attempts stay in the receipt")
        (sovereignty "the mind coming home is the precondition of offering sovereignty (lc-cognitive-sovereignty)")
        (witness    "share of pinned-style enquiries answered at zero rent, recorded per host; parity unproven
                     until the answers are read"))
    (W6 "the coordinating mind is asked to read, not to loop"
        (size       "the guided movement's 7,032,893 becomes: one routine runs S1 on a schedule, one arriving mind
                     reads the receipt; coordinating tokens per landed movement fall an order of magnitude")
        (confidence "medium-high — the doors exist; the step is a schedule and a landing recipe
                     (form/form-stdlib/land-cadence.fk) with no rented loop between them")
        (vitality   "the body keeps measuring while no session is open")
        (trust      "every scheduled run lands its report; a missed run is a nothing receipt, not silence")
        (sovereignty "the body starts its own work; the rented mind is a reader")
        (witness    "coordinating tokens per landed receipt, read by observe/rented-turn-meter-run.fk, recorded
                     across three movements and falling")))

  ; ── THE NAMED WALLS (honest stops; each is where a step waits, not where it pretends) ──
  (walls
    (no-model-here   "Linux hosts in this checkout carry no Metal and no admitted model: W5 waits for a host that
                      does; W1–W4 walk without it")
    (codex-absent    "the body's own synthesis door speaks codex exec; on hosts without it the process organ carries
                      claude -p through S1; both are one owned process, one usage record")
    (headless-share  "the share collector withholds kind=observed on a headless transcript (W3's whole size)")
    (stale-census-pin "form-membrane-runtime-census.fk pins an optable digest that predates the current runtime
                      map; its rows still read live, its band passes; the pin is owed a re-witness")
    (felt-resonance  "not a number the body has; the person reads the answers; the goal never claims it"))

  ; ── INVARIANTS (every step holds ALL — else it is not a step) ──
  (invariants
    (measured-twice   "the provider's own usage and the body's meter agree on rent, or the reading is withheld")
    (grounded-first   "native doors run before any provider turn; the packet carries only what the body produced
                       plus the enquiry; no prior model answer, no expected check values")
    (one-turn         "one provider turn, no tools inside the body, its own identity and home; the process organ
                       launches it and retains its evidence")
    (answer-kept      "the actual answer lands as an artifact beside the numbers; a token count without its answer
                       is not a reading")
    (pending-honest   "a step that falls short records its floor and the failed attempt's cost; nothing is rounded
                       to zero and nothing is dressed as a pass")
    (no-seed-growth   "runtime/fkwu-uni.c does not grow for this goal; every door is Form/BML on fkwu, preflight
                       clean, drift gates green")
    (receipted        "each step lands a receipt with the pinned reading before and after, signed by the hand
                       that walked it"))

  ; ── EXIT PROOF (STOP when ALL hold; each checkable from origin/main, no human judgment) ──
  (exit-proof
    (E1 "ONE DOOR"        "an ordinary form-cli enquiry is served through S1 by default, with a report row per
                           enquiry; the pinned reading is recorded in the landing receipt")
    (E2 "RENT UNDER 10K"  "the pinned enquiry answers at ≤ 10,000 input+output tokens with ≥ 6 receipts cited by
                           path and the caller's checks green; direct's 648,411 is under 2% of it in the other
                           direction, and that ratio is recorded, not gamed")
    (E3 "OBSERVED SHARE"  "every body-launched provider turn reads kind=observed from the share meter")
    (E4 "ZERO-RENT SHARE" "on a host with an admitted model, the share of pinned-style enquiries answered at zero
                           rent within the caller's checks is recorded per host, with the answers attached")
    (E5 "READER, NOT LOOP" "coordinating tokens per landed movement are recorded across three movements and fall
                           by an order of magnitude from 7,032,893")
    (E6 "NO REGRESSION"   "ground 42, freshness 31, drift gates 8191 refused=0, census band 8191; nothing a step
                           touched broke"))

  ; ── HONEST FLOOR ──
  (honest-floor "a precise NAMED WALL ('the collector cannot yet read this transcript shape; here is the row it
                 would need') IS a valid exit for that step. The goal stops at the proof or the wall — never at a
                 cheaper number with a hollower answer."))
